  "description": "Sqlx 0.3.0 - Minimalist four-core module design focused on performance and usability.\n      Includes: Sqlx raw SQL, ExpressionToSql type-safe queries, RepositoryFor zero-code repositories, SqlTemplate high-performance templates.\n      Zero reflection, native AOT support, compile-time validation, suitable for cloud-native and microservice scenarios.",
